---
title: Docs Generation Pipeline
---
```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'dark','themeVariables':{'primaryTextColor':'#ddd','lineColor':'#9aa0a6'},'securityLevel':'loose'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Repo as Git Repo
    participant Mk as MkDocs/Sphinx
    participant GH as Pages/Artifacts
    link GH: "../index.html"
    %%{config: {"fontFamily":"Inter,Segoe UI,Arial"}}%%

    Dev->>Repo: Commit docs + diagrams
    Repo-->>Mk: CI triggers build
    Mk->>Mk: Render Markdown, Mermaid, AutoAPI
    Mk->>GH: Publish site
    GH-->>Dev: Preview/Deploy

    rect rgba(100,255,100,0.05)
    note over Mk,GH: Rendering & Publish Stage
    end
```
